# "i" (to) counts DOWN to the hour named, and triggers SOFT
# mutation on it: "chwarter i bedwar" is 03:45, "chwarter i dri" 02:45.
# Sources: en.wikibooks.org, "Welsh/Mynediad/Lesson 8" ("use i after half
# past", with the five-minute table); cy.wikipedia.org running text ("am
# chwarter i dri yn y prynhawn", "Am chwarter i saith").
i
